\",\"line\":5,\"span\":\"This BIP describes the implementation of a mnemonic code or mnemonic sentence -- a group of easy to remember words -- for the generation of deterministic wallets.\"},{\"text\":\"BIP 39 consists of two parts: generating the mnemonic and converting it into a binary seed.\",\"line\":5,\"span\":\"It consists of two parts: generating the mnemonic and converting it into a binary seed.\"},{\"text\":\"The BIP 39 binary seed can later be used to generate deterministic wallets using BIP-0032 or similar methods.\",\"line\":5,\"span\":\"This seed can later be used to generate deterministic wallets using BIP-0032 or similar methods.\"},{\"text\":\"BIP 39 falls under the GPL License.\",\"line\":9,\"span\":\"This BIP falls under the GPL License.\"},{\"text\":\"A mnemonic sentence could be written on paper or spoken over the telephone.\",\"line\":13,\"span\":\"The sentence could be written on paper or spoken over the telephone.\"},{\"text\":\"BIP 39 is meant to be a way to transport computer-generated randomness with a human-readable transcription.\",\"line\":15,\"span\":\"This guide is meant to be a way to transport computer-generated randomness with a human-readable transcription.\"},{\"text\":\"BIP 39 is not a way to process user-created sentences into a wallet seed.\",\"line\":15,\"span\":\"It is not a way to process user-created sentences (also known as brainwallets) into a wallet seed.\"},{\"text\":\"User-created sentences are also known as brainwallets.\",\"line\":15,\"span\":\"It is not a way to process user-created sentences (also known as brainwallets) into a wallet seed.\"},{\"text\":\"The BIP 39 mnemonic must encode entropy in a multiple of 32 bits.\",\"line\":19,\"span\":\"The mnemonic must encode entropy in a multiple of 32 bits.\"},{\"text\":\"With more entropy, security of the BIP 39 mnemonic is improved.\",\"line\":19,\"span\":\"With more entropy, security is improved but the sentence length increases.\"},{\"text\":\"With more entropy, the BIP 39 mnemonic sentence length increases.\",\"line\":19,\"span\":\"With more entropy, security is improved but the sentence length increases.\"},{\"text\":\"In BIP 39, the initial entropy length is referred to as ENT.\",\"line\":19,\"span\":\"The initial entropy length is referred to as ENT.\"},{\"text\":\"In BIP 39, the allowed size of ENT is 128-256 bits.\",\"line\":19,\"span\":\"The allowed size of ENT is 128-256 bits.\"},{\"text\":\"In BIP 39 mnemonic generation, first an initial entropy of ENT bits is generated.\",\"line\":21,\"span\":\"First, an initial entropy of ENT bits is generated.\"},{\"text\":\"In BIP 39, a checksum is generated by taking the first ENT / 32 bits of the SHA256 hash of the initial entropy.\",\"line\":21,\"span\":\"A checksum is generated by taking the first ENT / 32 bits of its SHA256 hash.\"},{\"text\":\"In BIP 39, the checksum is appended to the end of the initial entropy.\",\"line\":21,\"span\":\"This checksum is appended to the end of the initial entropy.\"},{\"text\":\"In BIP 39, the concatenated entropy and checksum bits are split into groups of 11 bits.\",\"line\":21,\"span\":\"Next, these concatenated bits are split into groups of 11 bits, each encoding a number from 0-2047, serving as an index into a wordlist.\"},{\"text\":\"In BIP 39, each group of 11 bits encodes a number from 0-2047.\",\"line\":21,\"span\":\"Next, these concatenated bits are split into groups of 11 bits, each encoding a number from 0-2047, serving as an index into a wordlist.\"},{\"text\":\"In BIP 39, each 11-bit number serves as an index into a wordlist.\",\"line\":21,\"span\":\"Next, these concatenated bits are split into groups of 11 bits, each encoding a number from 0-2047, serving as an index into a wordlist.\"},{\"text\":\"In BIP 39, the 11-bit numbers are converted into words.\",\"line\":21,\"span\":\"Finally, these numbers are converted into words and the joined words are used as the mnemonic sentence.\"},{\"text\":\"In BIP 39, the joined words are used as the mnemonic sentence.\",\"line\":21,\"span\":\"Finally, these numbers are converted into words and the joined words are used as the mnemonic sentence.\"},{\"text\":\"In BIP 39, the checksum length CS equals ENT / 32.\",\"line\":26,\"span\":\"CS = ENT / 32\"},{\"text\":\"In BIP 39, the mnemonic sentence length MS in words equals (ENT + CS) / 11.\",\"line\":27,\"span\":\"MS = (ENT + CS) / 11\"},{\"text\":\"In BIP 39, an ENT of 128 gives a CS of 4, ENT+CS of 132, and MS of 12.\",\"line\":31,\"span\":\"|  128  |  4 |   132  |  12  |\"},{\"text\":\"In BIP 39, an ENT of 160 gives a CS of 5, ENT+CS of 165, and MS of 15.\",\"line\":32,\"span\":\"|  160  |  5 |   165  |  15  |\"},{\"text\":\"In BIP 39, an ENT of 192 gives a CS of 6, ENT+CS of 198, and MS of 18.\",\"line\":33,\"span\":\"|  192  |  6 |   198  |  18  |\"},{\"text\":\"In BIP 39, an ENT of 224 gives a CS of 7, ENT+CS of 231, and MS of 21.\",\"line\":34,\"span\":\"|  224  |  7 |   231  |  21  |\"},{\"text\":\"In BIP 39, an ENT of 256 gives a CS of 8, ENT+CS of 264, and MS of 24.\",\"line\":35,\"span\":\"|  256  |  8 |   264  |  24  |\"}]}","ttft_ms":15438,"type":"result","duration_ms":15477,"uuid":"16f68f54-3f9e-4b1a-89b7-f94094011dbf","ttft_stream_ms":1614,"time_to_request_ms":100,"first_content_frame_ms":1614,"queued_turn_count":0,"result_index":0}
